<title>SWITZERLAND: TENNIS-SWITZERLAND LEAD ARGENTINA 2-0 IN FED CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWITZERLAND LEAD ARGENTINA 2-0 IN FED CUP.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the first day of Fed Cup World Group two tie between Switzerland and Argentina on Saturday:</p>
<p>(Swiss names first)</p>
<p>Martina Hingis beat Marie Jose Gaidano 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Patty Schnyder beat Florencia Labat 3-6 7-5 10-8</p>
<p>Switzerland lead 2-0</p>
</text>
